:: Casey Introduction
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
You walk up to them and introduce yourself. They blow another puff of smoke and take a glance your way. “Now you look nice and all but I aint looking for a chat so beat it.” They make a shooing motion with their hand and put the cigar back into their mouth with the other.
<br><br>
<<link [[Persist|Casey Again]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Listen and leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $caseyagain to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Casey Again
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
They blow another puff of smoke and take a glance your way. “Didn’t I tell you to leave me alone? Look, I’m not looking for company, just scram.” You slide closer to them. “Fine. If I tell you my name will you leave me alone?” <<He>> doesn’t wait for an answer. “It’s Casey. Now can you leave?” <<He>> says as <<he>> turns you around and pushes you away.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $caseymet to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Casey Hang Out
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
<<if $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Casey")].love lte 40>>
    <<cleareventpool>>
    <<addinlineevent "casey_convo_1">>
        “Why do you keep coming back? I told you I want to be left alone so could you go away?” You spend a while silently hanging around Casey.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
    <<addinlineevent "casey_convo_2">>>
        “You’re really insistent you know that?” <<He>> shakes <<his>> head. “Can’t I chill in peace?” You spend a while silently hanging around Casey.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
    <<addinlineevent "casey_convo_3">>
        “Look I get you’re probably lonely and all, but it doesn’t mean you have to hang out with me.” You spend a while silently hanging around Casey.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
    <<addinlineevent "casey_convo_4">>
        “Come on. This again? Just get out of here.” You spend a while silently hanging out with Casey.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
    <<runeventpool>>

<<elseif $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Casey")].love lte 80>>
    <<cleareventpool>>
    <<addinlineevent "casey_convo_5">>
        “Why don’t I go to school? Dropped out a while ago I like to live life in the fast lane and school’s just too slow for me.” You spend a while hanging out with Casey.
