:: Casey Smoke
You take the cigar and inhale as you start to cough. You spend a while hanging out with Casey.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Casey Deny Smoke
You refuse the cigar. Casey shrugs and continues to smoke. You spend a while hanging out with Casey.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Casey Ride Home
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
"Hey I was waiting for you. 
<<if $caseyridefirst is 0>>
Check out this baby." <<He>> says patting <<his>> motorcycle. "Custom made. Built it out of parts I found in the landfill. Took a while to put together and get working but she's a beauty ain't she. Of course she has nothing on you though." <<He>> lets out a small laugh.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> hops on the motorcycle and offers you a hand. You take <<his>> hand and climb on behind <<him>>. "Make sure to hold on tight. You don't want to fall off." <<He>> says as the engine fires and you start to move. 
<br><br>
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
You hold on loosely enjoying the breeze. <<He>> smiles as he can tell you're having a good time.
<<else>>
You wrap your arms around <<him>> tightly. <<He>> starts to blush and says "Is everything alright back there?" You nod and continue to hold <<him>>. 
<</if>>
<br><br>
You arrive home and dismount the bike. "I hope you enjoyed the ride." Casey says smiling.
<br><br>
<<link [[Say Goodbye|Bye Motor]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $promiscuity gte 15>>
<<link [[Kiss Goodbye|Kiss Motor]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bye Motor
"See you later." You say waving as <<he>> remounts his bike and rides away.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Domus Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Kiss Motor
You lean in close and give <<him>> a kiss. <<He>> blushes for a moment before kissing you back. "Wow, not what I was expecting." <<He>> says smiling. "Not that I'm complaining. See you later." <<He>> says as he remounts his bike and rides away.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Domus Street]]>><<endevent>><<takeKissVirginity Casey romantic>><</link>>

:: Casey Walk Home
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
You take Casey's hand and walk home together. <<He>> makes sure you're covered the entire way and even gets a bit wet <<himself>>. "Well here we are. It's a shame but I should probably get going."
<br><br>
<<link [[Say Goodbye|Bye Casey]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $promiscuity gte 15>>
<<link [[Kiss Goodbye|Kiss Casey]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

