:: Casey Walk Home Robin
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
You ask if Robin can come along. Casey stands silent for a moment before saying "Sure I suppose your little friend can come along." Putting emphasis on the word friend. The walk home is quiet and awkward as Casey gives Robin a glare from time to time, hardly hiding it. Upon arriving home Casey pulls you close and kisses you. "See you later." <<He>> smiles glancing towards Robin and walks away.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Domus Street]]>><<endevent>><<takeKissVirginity Casey romantic>><</link>>

:: Casey Hello
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
"Oh hey didn't expect to see you here, the lock to get in is quite hard to pick." Casey grins and flashed <<his>> lockpick. "Of course it's nothing to me. I'm just digging for some scrap to build with. You might not know but I'm pretty handy with this stuff."
<br><br>
<<link [[Help Scavenge|Help Scavenge]]>><<set $rng to random(1,100)>><<npcincr Casey love 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Trash]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Help Scavenge
"Wait really? I didn't take you for the type to do that. I appreciate the help." <<He>> says as he continues to dig. 
<br><br>
<<if $rng is 1>>
You start scrounging through a scrap pile and find a seemingly intact nice looking motor. "Wow this is an incredible find." Casey runs over and gives it a touch. "Extremely nice condition, this is the best thing I could have asked for." <<He>> gives you a hug "I'm gonna bring this home and get to work.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Trash]]>><<npcincr Casey love 10>><<set $motorupgrade to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
You start scrounging through a scrap pile. You don't find anything of use but Casey seems to appreciate the effort.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Trash]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>